CmdPalm uses a modified copy of askama_derive 0.16.1.

Upstream: https://github.com/askama-rs/askama
Commit: 9ae4d5bdf4352b35e34106e38944c90d7a7ede3e
Crate: https://crates.io/crates/askama_derive/0.16.1

Local changes:
- Cargo.toml and Cargo.toml.orig replace optional basic-toml with toml 1.1,
  using only its parse, serde and std features.
- src/config.rs uses toml::from_str for Askama configuration parsing.
- This NOTICE and UPSTREAM.json record the patch and upstream provenance.

The original MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses are included unchanged. The source
is in vendor/askama_derive in https://github.com/rahatsagor/CmdPalm.
Remove this patch when a compatible upstream Askama release removes
basic-toml. Do not replace it with an advisory ignore rule.
